B.atT=new A.na("Privacy Policy | CommonsLens","Learn how CommonsLens works without analytics or advertising trackers, what stays on your device, which providers receive necessary requests, and what is not collected.","https://commonslens.github.io/privacy/",!0)
B.atU=new A.na("Wikimedia Commons Map Search | CommonsLens","Discover geotagged Wikimedia Commons media with point, radius, and place searches, clustered previews, metadata filters, and downloadable results.","https://commonslens.github.io/map/",!0)
B.atV=new A.na("CommonsLens Docs \u2014 Search, Understand, and Reuse Wikimedia Media","Learn how to search, filter, map, inspect, bookmark, export, and reuse Wikimedia Commons media with CommonsLens, including what happens to your data.","https://commonslens.github.io/docs/",!0)
B.atW=new A.na("CommonsLens Features \u2014 Wikimedia Search, Map & Export","Explore every CommonsLens feature: advanced Wikimedia search, Wikidata and license filters, map discovery, attribution tools, metadata CSV export, and visual data pipelines.","https://commonslens.github.io/features/",!0)
